WEBVTT

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:04.532
You've watched the airplanes cross the Chicago sky.

00:00:04.532 --> 00:00:07.557
At Aviation Professionals, you learn to fly one.

00:00:09.039 --> 00:00:14.944
We're a family-owned flight school at Chicago Midway, teaching people to fly since 1975.

00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:17.359
The oldest flight school in Chicago.

00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:22.669
And we teach a method you won't find anywhere else: Attitude Flying.

00:00:22.669 --> 00:00:28.111
You fly the airplane by what you see out the window, not by chasing needles on the panel.

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:34.072
The nose, the strut, the wingtip and the windowsill are your instruments.

00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:39.988
Set the picture, trim off the pressure, and the airplane flies itself while you look outside.

00:00:41.306 --> 00:00:47.397
Two rules never change. Throttle controls airspeed. The control wheel controls altitude.

00:00:47.397 --> 00:00:51.066
Learn those, and every maneuver after builds on them.

00:00:52.382 --> 00:00:58.942
Every API student also gets our training app, on your phone and your computer, from your very first lesson.

00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:02.958
Open it and you see exactly where you stand:

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:06.734
your phase, your percentage complete, and what comes next.

00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:16.296
Your training moves through seventeen flight phases in four stages, each one built on the last, from your first taxi to your checkride.

00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:22.026
After every flight, your instructor marks each standard met or not yet.

00:01:22.026 --> 00:01:26.088
You always know what you nailed, and what to work on next time.

00:01:27.405 --> 00:01:34.351
Every skill lines up with the FAA's Airman Certification Standards, the same standards your examiner uses.

00:01:34.351 --> 00:01:39.725
Watch your ACS coverage fill in as you train, so checkride day holds no surprises.

00:01:40.878 --> 00:01:43.382
Your full API syllabus lives in the app:

00:01:43.382 --> 00:01:52.398
the attitude flying references, the traffic pattern, the landing profiles and every maneuver, all illustrated and ready to study before you fly.

00:01:53.715 --> 00:02:00.595
Each phase shows what you'll fly, the pictures to study, and what a good flight looks like, so you show up prepared.

00:02:01.912 --> 00:02:07.756
Your digital logbook keeps every flight, signed by your instructor, with your totals always up to date.

00:02:07.756 --> 00:02:09.912
Your endorsements are right there too.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:14.462
Got a question at midnight? Ask Bill, our training assistant.

00:02:14.462 --> 00:02:18.900
He knows your record and the syllabus, and he'll even read the answer aloud.

00:02:20.382 --> 00:02:27.262
A proven method, a family that cares, and a clear view of your progress, from first flight to checkride.

00:02:28.777 --> 00:02:39.337
Aviation Professionals, at Chicago Midway. com to book your first lesson.

